flowchart TB
  I[Internet] -->|TLS| LB[Edge/Nginx TLS+headers]
  LB --> S[SPA static build]
  LB --> A1[app #1] & A2[app #2 ...]
  A1 & A2 --> PGP[(PostgreSQL primary)]
  PGP -. replica .-> PGR[(read replica opt.)]
  A1 & A2 --> RP[(Redis)]
  W1[queue #1] & W2[queue #2] --> PGP
  W1 & W2 --> GEMp[Gemini]
  SCHp[scheduler] --> RP
  BK[Backups → offsite] --> PGP
